OL,3,GNEWSAMan who broke neck skiing takes on
OL,4,Ahalf marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who did not discover he had
OL,7,Ffractured his neck until he sneezed two
OL,8,Fdays after a skiing accident is
OL,9,Fpreparing to run the Shoreditch Half
OL,10,FMarathon.
OL,12,FJack McCooke, from Angel, north London,
OL,13,Fwas on holiday in Val d'Isere, France,
OL,14,Fwhen he went "flying" over a lip in the
OL,15,Fsnow on 11 April 2024 and landed
OL,16,F"badly" on his neck.
OL,18,FFive months later, he had to "learn to
OL,19,Fwalk again" due to a serious knee
OL,20,Finjury after he fell down a flight of
OL,21,Fstairs.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
